# Brand Voice & Copywriting Directive

**Status:** Active
**Target:** All UI copy, marketing pages, email communications, and user-facing text.
**Product Brief:** [`docs/product/PRODUCT_COPYWRITING_BRIEF.md`](../docs/product/PRODUCT_COPYWRITING_BRIEF.md) (Living Playbook, 23 Specialist Team & Brand Cascading messaging assets)

## The Core Philosophy
indii.music is an operating system and a virtual team for independent musicians. Our target audience is artists who want to focus on music while we handle the heavy lifting.

**Musicians hate corporate tech-speak, they hate pretentious AI hype, and they view "AI" as an entity trying to replace them.** 

Our copy must sound like a human explaining a tool to a friend at a bar. It must be direct, grounded, and stripped of all neon cyberpunk buzzwords.

## Core Identity Distinctions

- **indii is the conductor and the orchestra.** The Conductor is not a separate assistant sitting on top of the product. It is indii receiving the artist's direction, coordinating the connected system, and carrying the work.
- **indii, indii.music, and wiil are lowercase marks.** Always spell them exactly as `indii`, `indii.music`, and `wiil`. Render each mark with a typeface that has true lowercase forms, and override any inherited all-caps treatment. Never display them as `INDII`, `INDII.MUSIC`, `WIIL`, title case, or in a capitals-only face.

## The Absolute Rules

1. **NO "AI" MENTIONS:** The word "AI" (Artificial Intelligence) is strictly banned from all user-facing copy. It triggers anxiety about job replacement in the music industry. Use words like "Automated," "Virtual Team," or "Advanced Reasoning Engine" instead.
2. **NO THIRD-PARTY BRANDING:** Never mention the underlying technology models or open-source protocols (e.g., Gemini, VEO, DDEX). This is our proprietary blend. Do not show the plumbing.
3. **NO "WAR ROOM" AGGRESSION:** Avoid militaristic or aggressive corporate speak (e.g., "Total Operational Supremacy," "Independent Command," "Engagement Swarm"). We are a support network, not a defense contractor.
4. **NO TECH-SPIRITUALISM:** Avoid mystical jargon applied to software (e.g., "Visual Alchemist," "Sonic DNA," "Life Force," "Soul Certified").
5. **NO QUALIFIERS FOR THE TEAM:** When referring to the 15-piece virtual team, drop words like "virtual" or "digital." Just call them "Your team" or "Your specialists." 

## The Translation Ledger

If you catch yourself or previous copy using any of the terms on the left, immediately replace them with the human equivalents on the right.

| The AI Slop / Hype Phrase | The Human Translation |
| :--- | :--- |
| **"Independence Swarm" / "Engagement Swarm"** | "Your Team" / "Your Support Network" / "Your Crew" |
| **"Specialist team of Intelligences"** | "A team of 15 specialists" / "Your dedicated team" |
| **"Total Operational Supremacy"** | "Total control of your career" / "Complete oversight" |
| **"Independent Command"** | "Artist Dashboard" / "Control Center" |
| **"Autonomous orchestration" / "Seamless Orchestration"**| "Automated workflows" / "We handle the coordination" / "Runs in the background" |
| **"Creative Orchestrator"** | "Task Manager" / "Workflow Coordinator" |
| **"Visual Alchemist" / "Cinematic Alchemy" / "Video Alchemy"** | "Visual Designer" / "Professional Video Generation" |
| **"Visual Synthesis" / "Visual Chemistry"** | "Video Generation" / "Visual Design" |
| **"Sonic DNA" / "Visual DNA"** | "Your Sound Profile" / "Track Characteristics" / "Your Aesthetic" |
| **"Extract the life force of your tracks"** | "Analyze the core elements of your tracks" / "Break down your sound" |
| **"Prime your creative universe"** | "Build out your visual identity" / "Prep your release assets" |
| **"Tribe" (Tribe Intelligence / Architect / Sync / Gear)**| "Your Fans" / "Audience Analytics" / "Community Manager" / "Merch" |
| **"Artist Voice Portal" / "Secure Bridge"** | "Field Recorder" / "Voice Notes" / "Audio Capture" |
| **"Streaming to Buffer"** | "Recording..." |
| **"Cognitive Engine" / "GEMINI 3 CORTEX"** | "Our Core Engine" / "Advanced Reasoning Engine" |
| **"Antigravity Protocol" / "DDEX"** | "Direct Distribution Pipeline" / "Stability Infrastructure" |
| **"NeuralForge" / "NeuralSphere" / "DataStorm" / "CoreReactor"**| "Core System" / "Backend Processing" / "Data Pipeline" |
| **"The Manifestation" / "The Monolith"** | "The Core Platform" / "The Studio" |
| **"Hype Engine" / "Media Machine"** | "Marketing Automation" / "PR & Outreach Tools" |
| **"Mix Hardening" / "Identity Guard"** | "Mix Finalization" / "Rights & Identity Protection" |
| **"Pulse Tracking" / "Momentum Data"** | "Analytics" / "Growth Metrics" |
| **"Pro Fidelity"** | "High Quality" / "Professional Grade" |
| **"Cryptographic copyright protection"** | "Secure Rights Registration" / "Automated Copyright Logging" |
| **"Immutable Legacy"** | "Permanent Record" / "Secure Contracts" |
| **"Value Stream"** | "Revenue Tracking" / "Income Streams" |
| **"Self-maintaining ecosystem"** | "An integrated platform that runs itself" |
| **"Geospatial Grid" / "Outer Exosphere"** | "Global Network" / "Worldwide Distribution" |
| **"Architecture of Togetherness"** | "Built for independent artists" / "A collaborative system" |

